      <costs>
        <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
        <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
        <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
        <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <infoGroups>
        <infoGroup name="Prioritised Efficiency" id="c981-026a-ee10-8836" hidden="false">
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Your Army gains 1 Yield Point:" id="8499-7982-e930-398f" hidden="false" typeId="fc45-0dd2-18a2-d038" typeName=" Prioritised Efficiency">
              <comment>Each time one of the following happens during a Battle round, your Army gains 1 Yield Point.</comment>
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="d6aa-54e0-1b13-d745">- Each time two enemy units without SACRIFICEABLE Keyword are destroyed.
- Each time you gain control of an objective located inside the opponent Deployment zone.
- Each time you gain control of more objectives than your opponent in No-man&apos;s land.
- Each end of Battle Round you mantain control of more objectives than your opponent.
- Each time you complete two mission-related Actions.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Your Army loses 1 Yield Point:" id="2e1a-d798-d9f9-943e" hidden="false" typeId="fc45-0dd2-18a2-d038" typeName=" Prioritised Efficiency">
              <comment>Each time one of the following happens during a Battle round, your Army loses 1 Yield Point.</comment>
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="d6aa-54e0-1b13-d745">- Each time two friendly units without SACRIFICEABLE Keyword are destroyed.
- Each time your opponent gain control of an objective located inside your Deployment zone.
- Each time your opponent gain control of more objectives than you in No-man&apos;s land.
- Each end of Battle Round your opponent mantain control of more objectives than you.
- Each time your opponent completes two mission-related Actions.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" -" id="ed2a-6220-36f3-1b10" hidden="false" typeId="fc45-0dd2-18a2-d038" typeName=" Prioritised Efficiency">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="d6aa-54e0-1b13-d745">- At the start of the battle, your Army starts with 5YP, and your units have Hostile Acquisition active.
- Your Army cannot accumulate more than 10 Yield Points, and cannot have less than 0.
- Each time the accumulated Yield Points reach a treshold, the Ability changes to the apropiate one as shown in the Accumulated YP table.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Gaining Judgement tokens." id="a05b-b07c-2ca6-74e5" hidden="true">
              <description>Gaining Judgement tokens.
Enemy units will gain Judgement tokens (to a maximum of 3) throughout the battle as follows:
- Each time an enemy unit destroys a VOTANN unit from your army, that enemy unit gains 1 Judgement token.
- Each time an enemy unit successfully completes an action or a psychic action within 12&quot; of a VOTANN unit from your army, it gains 1 Judgement token.
- At the end of each of your opponent’s turns, you can select one enemy unit within range of an objective marker that your opponent controls and were controled by you in the previous turn. That unit gains 1 Judgement token.

If a unit with any Judgement tokens is removed from the battlefield (e.g. because it embarked on a TRANSPORT, is entering Strategic Reserves, etc.) make a note of how many Judgement tokens it had when it was removed. If that unit is set up on the battlefield again, place the corresponding number of Judgement tokens next to it again.

If a unit with one or more Judgement tokens splits up into two or more smaller units, each of those units gains a number of Judgement tokens equal to that of the original unit. If two or more units combine to form a single large unit, and any of those units had one or more Judgement tokens, make a note of how many are on the unit with the most just before they combined - the new larger unit has a number of Judgement tokens equal to this.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </infoGroup>
        <infoGroup name="YP Table" id="8f5b-4232-3470-0e46" hidden="false">
          <profiles>
            <profile name=" 0-3" id="eb11-a8d7-1cc5-d4e5" hidden="false" noindex="false" typeId="d1eb-d802-b6af-f1a7" typeName="Accumulated YP">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Name" typeId="5c35-a264-663d-b4ca">A Grudge to settle.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2426-8023-b954-8848">Friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; units from your Army can make a Charge move even if the unit has Advanced in the previous Movement phase or disembarked from a TRANSPORT.
Friendly LEAGUE units from your Army ignore the Hit roll penalty of firing Assault weapons when the unit has Advanced in the previous Movement phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" 4-6" id="6a49-1a0e-c967-ac0c" hidden="false" noindex="false" typeId="d1eb-d802-b6af-f1a7" typeName="Accumulated YP">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Name" typeId="5c35-a264-663d-b4ca">Hostile Acquisition</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2426-8023-b954-8848">Friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; units from your Army can re‑roll Advance and Charge rolls.
Friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; INFANTRY units from your Army ignore the Hit roll penalty of firing Heavy weapons when the unit has Moved in the previous Movement phase.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name=" 7-10" id="76d2-c88d-a983-f0ed" hidden="false" noindex="false" typeId="d1eb-d802-b6af-f1a7" typeName="Accumulated YP">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Name" typeId="5c35-a264-663d-b4ca">Fortify Takeover</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2426-8023-b954-8848">Add 1 to Armour saving throws made by friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; models from your Army that are receiving the benefits of cover or within range of a objective.
When a friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; unit from your Army is performing an action, models in that unit can shoot without that action failing.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
      </infoGroups>
