                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a &lt;LEAGUE&gt; model with this custom makes a melee attack, if the target of that melee attack was within Engagement Range of 2 or more &lt;LEAGUE&gt; CORE units from your army when the attacking unit was selected to fight, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
