              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, the first time a saving throw is failed for the bearer’s unit, the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0.
In addition, in each of your Command phases, if the bearer&apos;s unit is not in engagement range of enemy units, you can select either one unit from your army within 3&quot; of the bearer, that is below its Starting Strength and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units or the bearer&apos;s unit. One destroyed INFANTRY model without INORGANIC Keyword is returned to that unit, with all its Wounds remaining.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
