      <profiles>
        <profile name="Brôkhyr’s Guild" id="32d8-16db-b8c2-605e" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this unit can either:
- Repair one friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; VEHICLE, &lt;LEAGUE&gt; EXO-DRILL, &lt;LEAGUE&gt; INORGANIC INFANTRY, &lt;LEAGUE&gt; DRONE or &lt;LEAGUE&gt; EXO-ARMOUR model within 3&quot; of it. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.
- Select one unit from your army within 3&quot; that is below its Starting Strength and not within Engagement Range of any enemy units. One destroyed INFANTRY model with INORGANIC Keyword is returned to that unit, with all its Wounds remaining.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Multispectral Visor" id="b614-bda5-bbb7-d7d2" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, if this unit contains a BRÔKHYR IRON-MASTER model, you can select one friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; CORE or &lt;LEAGUE&gt; VEHICLE unit within 9&quot; of this unit. If you do so, until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that friendly unit makes an attack with a ranged weapon, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="CORV Support" id="8f92-fe09-06c8-2356" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this unit uses its Brôkhyr’s Guild ability, if this unit contains 1 or more DRONE models, the model being repaired regains 1 additional lost wound.
If this unit’s BRÔKHYR IRON-MASTER model is ever destroyed, all of this unit’s remaining DRONE models are also destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Ironkin Assistant" id="5505-5662-805d-6092" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this unit contains an IRONKIN ASSISTANT model, this unit can perform actions even if it has Advanced, and it can shoot without its action failing.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
