        <profile name="Leaping charge" id="86e5-d117-310c-4a6d" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model ends a charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of this model and roll one D6: if the result is an unmodified 6, or if it equals or beats the highest Toughness characteristic in that enemy unit, add D3 to the Attacks characteristic of this model.</characteristic>
