            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; IRONKIN CORE model&apos;s unit is within 9&quot; of this unit, each time an IRONKIN model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to that attack’s Hit roll.</characteristic>
