- While the bearer’s unit contains at least one DRONE model, the bearer can attempt to deny one additional psychic power in each of your opponent’s Psychic phases.
- While the bearer’s unit contains at least one DRONE model, add 1 to Deny the Witch tests taken for the bearer.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
