                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Once per battle, before making a saving throw for the bearer, it can activate this Relic. If it does so, then until the end of the phase, the bearer has a 3+ invulnerable save.
