              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time the bearer makes a Normal Move, Advances, Falls Back or makes a charge move, until that move is finished, it can move horizontally through models and terrain features (it cannot finish a move on top of another model, or its base).
- Enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12&quot; of this model’s unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Wayfarer&apos;s Grace" id="76f4-e205-0edf-6057" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
