              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle round, when a saving throw is failed for the bearer, the bearer can use this Relic. When it does so, the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0. 
Each time the bearer uses this Relic, roll one D6: on a 5+, the unit that made that attack gains 1 Judgement token.</characteristic>
