                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD uses an ability in your Command phase that specifies a range, you can add 3&quot; to the range of that ability (to a maximum of 12&quot;).
- Add 3&quot; to the range of this WARLORD’s Aura abilities (to a maximum of 12&quot;).</characteristic>
