              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the wound roll.
- Each time a melee attack made by this WARLORD is allocated to an enemy model, that enemy model cannot use any rules to ignore the wounds it loses.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
