            <profile name="Voidship support" id="377b-ddb5-a03d-9633" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, this WARLORD can call for an Orbital ion beam. Set up a marker for that strike.
After Rectifying Telemetry, Roll 1D6 and add 6 to the result. Draw a straight, imaginary line, 2&quot; width, between the Tactical weapon marker, and put a second marker within the distance marked by the roll result. Roll attacks for each unit that the line between the two points crosses over.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Orbital ion beam" id="d500-dafb-7010-9cf1" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48" typeName="Weapon">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Range" typeId="6fa97fa8-ea74-4a27-a0fb-bc4e5f367464">Tactical (2&quot;)</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Type" typeId="077c342f-d7b9-45c6-b8af-88e97cafd3a2">Heavy D6</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">12</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Tactical weapon. 
This weapon is fired with an unmodifiable BS of 3+. This weapon can only be fired once per battle. Each time an attack is made with this weapon against units without MONSTER, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, that attack automatically hits the target.
Blast.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
