                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD repairs a model using its Brôkhyr’s Guild ability, the model being repaired regains up to 3 lost wounds instead of D3.
- Once per battle round, when a saving throw is failed for a friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; VEHICLE or &lt;LEAGUE&gt; EXO-FRAME model that is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, this WARLORD can use this trait. When it does so, the Damage characteristic of that attack is changed to 0.</characteristic>
