              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly &lt;LEAGUE&gt; CORE or &lt;LEAGUE&gt; CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, you can re-roll the hit roll.</characteristic>
